    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-6 py-16 md:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_300px] lg:gap-16" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/ann-arbor-domestic-violence.astro:c3wtha">
      <div class="min-w-0" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/ann-arbor-domestic-violence.astro:c3wthb">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-[clamp(1.75rem,1.2rem+1.6vw,2.5rem)] font-black leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.5px] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/ann-arbor-domestic-violence.astro:9gbwg2">
          Ann Arbor Domestic Violence Charges Require An Experienced, Established, and Capable Defense. We Defend These Charges:
        </h2>

        <img
          class="mt-8 aspect-[2.1/1] w-full rounded-[4px] object-cover"
          src={mainImageSrc}
